---
source: crates/sb/tests/docker.rs
expression: "help(&[\"docker\", \"ps\", \"--help\"])"
---

  List all Docker containers and their status, displaying their internal
  ports (as potentially exposed by Traefik labels) and their external port bindings.

  USAGE

    sb docker ps [--flags]

  FLAGS

    --color    Controls when to use color (auto)
    -h --help  Help for ps
    --json     Print the containers as JSON
